out what their "favorite part" was -- 'the guy on the
toilet!' -- 'the scene in the kitchen!' -- 'the rex
chasing the jeep!' -- my answer:  when the paleontologists
encounter their first dinosaur.

2. Little kids.  Because we got to the theater just before
showtime, we had to sit right up front (I usually try to
figure out an excuse to do that).  We were surrounded by
parents with their kids.  Somewhere around halftime, I
looked around, and we were _alone_.  Apparently it is
rather strong stuff for many young humans (or else parents).

